        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic, two-bedroom, second floor apartment with a private South-facing balcony filling the property with natural light all day long. No. 52 Horizon Building is a well-maintained apartment, which enjoys spacious accommodation and is presented as the perfect blank canvas. Ideally positioned neighbouring the Royal Canal Park, this apartment is just a 5-minute walk from Pelletstown Train Station, providing fast and convenient access to Dublin City Centre & Maynooth.  Residents enjoy an excellent range of amenities on their doorstep, including cafés, restaurants, Aldi, gym, crèche and scenic walks along the Royal Canal. The Phoenix Park, Ashtown Village, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the National Aquatic Centre, and the M50 are all within easy reach, making this an exceptionally convenient and well-connected location.\n\nThis bright and spacious apartment comprises of c. 71 sq m including an entrance hallway with a storage closet currently used as a utility room (plumbed for washing machine and dryer), open plan diner/living space with a modern kitchen, two double bedrooms and a main family bathroom. One of the outstanding features of this property is the private balcony, which enjoys a South facing origentation. Additionally, there is a designated parking space to the front of the building.\n\nNo.52 comes to the market in fantastic condition throughout and boasts vacant possession with no onward chain, B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, utility room, South facing balcony,designated parking, ideal commuting location and top quality flooring & fittings throughout. This fine apartment is ideal for first time buyers and investors alike. Early viewing is highly advised, Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing on 01 403 0720.\n\nFeatures:\n- 2 Bed/ 1 Bath 2nd Floor Apartment\n- B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage\n- SOUTH facing balcony\n- 5 Minute walk to Pelletstown Train Station!\n- Utility room/ Storage Closet\n- Electric Storage Heaters\n- Light filled interior\n- Designated Parking\n- Two Double Bedrooms\n- Management fee c. 2,300 p/a\n- Within easy access to a host of shops and supermarkets\n- A host of transport links at your doorstep\n- Ashtown Village & Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within easy reach\n- Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections:\n\nWhen walking from Aldi, head straight on the Beacon road and cross the road. You will see the building's main door ' Horizon Apartments 41-60'. Take the lift or stairs to the 2nd floor and you will find no. 52 on the right hand side."
      },
